// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`rendered markup snapshots > complete 1`] = `"<nav class="passport-actions" aria-label="Actions for this record"><ul><li><a class="passport-action passport-action-compare" href="/ModelTree/compare/?models=complete-model" data-action="compare">Compare Complete Model with another model</a><span class="passport-action-description">Opens the comparison with this release already chosen. Add one to three more to see them side by side, each value with the source it came from.</span></li><li><a class="passport-action passport-action-evidence" href="#usage-title" data-action="evidence">See the evidence for this record</a><span class="passport-action-description">Jumps to the usage evidence, conditional fit guidance, and primary sources below.</span></li><li><a class="passport-action passport-action-report" href="https://github.com/abdeslam-menacere/ModelTree/issues/new?title=Data+correction%3A+Example+Complete+Model+2+%28complete-model%29&amp;body=Record+slug%3A+complete-model%0ARecord%3A+Example+Complete+Model+2%0ACurrently+verified+at%3A+2026-08-15%0A%0AWhat+is+incorrect%3A%0A%0APrimary+source+that+states+the+correct+value+%28a+URL+is+required%29%3A%0A" data-action="report">Report incorrect data<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a><span class="passport-action-description">Opens a prefilled correction issue naming the record slug complete-model.</span></li></ul></nav><section class="passport-section identity-section" aria-labelledby="identity-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">01</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Identity</span><h2 id="identity-title">What it is</h2></div></div><div class="passport-summary"><p class="passport-summary-text">A fictional release with every optional field populated.</p><p class="passport-purpose"><strong>When to use it.</strong> Exercising the passport when every record exists.</p><p class="passport-featured"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg>Featured in ModelTree because it is the fixture that exercises every populated branch</p></div><div class="passport-grid"><dl class="passport-facts"><div><dt>Creator</dt><dd>Example Lab</dd></div><div><dt>Family</dt><dd>Complete Family</dd></div><div><dt>Version</dt><dd>2</dd></div><div><dt>Variant</dt><dd>base</dd></div><div><dt>Released</dt><dd>Feb 10, 2026</dd></div><div><dt>Lifecycle status</dt><dd>Available</dd></div><div><dt>Access</dt><dd>Open-weight</dd></div><div><dt>Record slug</dt><dd>complete-model</dd></div></dl><div class="passport-names"><h3>Canonical record</h3><dl class="passport-facts"><div><dt>Canonical name</dt><dd>Example Complete Model 2</dd></div><div><dt>Canonical page</dt><dd><code>/ModelTree/models/complete-model/</code></dd></div><div><dt>Lifecycle</dt><dd>Available. The vendor’s currently offered version. Shown as “Available”. It is not a claim that the model is recommended or preferred — only that the vendor still offers it.</dd></div></dl><div class="tag-block"><h4>Also known as</h4><ul class="api-aliases"><li>Example Complete Model 2</li></ul></div><div class="tag-block"><h4>API identifiers</h4><ul class="api-aliases"><li><code>complete-model-2</code></li><li><code>complete-model-2-2026-02-10</code></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="passport-section" aria-labelledby="lineage-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">02</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Lineage</span><h2 id="lineage-title">Where it fits</h2></div></div><div class="family-trail"><span>Example Lab</span><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><span>Complete Family</span><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><strong>Complete Model</strong></div><div class="relationship-group" data-relationship="predecessor"><h3>Predecessors</h3><p class="relationship-note">Earlier releases this one is recorded as following in its own version line.</p><ul class="sibling-links"><li><a href="/ModelTree/models/earlier-model/">Earlier Model</a></li></ul></div><div class="relationship-group" data-relationship="successor"><h3>Successors</h3><p class="relationship-note">Later releases recorded as following this one. It does not mean this release is withdrawn.</p><ul class="sibling-links"><li><a href="/ModelTree/models/later-model/">Later Model</a></li></ul></div><div class="relationship-group" data-relationship="sibling"><h3>Sibling variants</h3><p class="relationship-note">Releases published as variants of the same family. It implies no ordering between them.</p><ul class="sibling-links"><li><a href="/ModelTree/models/variant-model/">Complete Model Mini</a></li></ul></div><div class="relationship-group" data-relationship="derivation"><h3>Derived from</h3><p class="relationship-note">Releases this one is recorded as being built from, such as a fine-tune or a distillation of another model.</p><ul class="sibling-links"><li><a href="/ModelTree/models/foundation-model/">Foundation Model</a></li></ul><p class="passport-unknown">1 related record(s) named here are not yet in ModelTree: never-reviewed-release.</p></div></section><section class="passport-section" aria-labelledby="technical-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">03</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Technical record</span><h2 id="technical-title">Documented limits</h2></div></div><dl class="technical-facts"><div><dt>Input modalities</dt><dd>text, image</dd></div><div><dt>Output modalities</dt><dd>text</dd></div><div><dt>Context window</dt><dd>200,000 tokens</dd></div><div><dt>Maximum output</dt><dd>32,000 tokens</dd></div><div><dt>Parameters</dt><dd>120B total, 12B active</dd></div></dl><div class="tag-groups"><div><span>Categories</span><ul><li>Language and reasoning</li><li>Coding</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="passport-section" aria-labelledby="access-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">04</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Access and licensing</span><h2 id="access-title">How you can get it</h2></div></div><p class="access-summary"><strong>Open-weight.</strong> Model weights can be downloaded. This alone says nothing about the licence: the schema records downloadable weights and OSI-approval as two separate booleans, so open-weight does not imply open-source.</p><p class="access-methodology"><a href="/ModelTree/methodology/#access">How ModelTree defines access and licensing</a></p><div class="licence-block"><h3>Licence</h3><dl class="technical-facts"><div><dt>Licence</dt><dd><a href="https://lab.example.com/licences/permissive">Example Permissive Licence 1.0<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a></dd></div><div><dt>SPDX identifier</dt><dd>Apache-2.0</dd></div><div><dt>Downloadable weights</dt><dd>Weights are documented as downloadable.</dd></div><div><dt>OSI-approved</dt><dd>The licence is recorded as OSI-approved open source.</dd></div></dl></div></section><section class="passport-section" aria-labelledby="availability-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">05</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Availability</span><h2 id="availability-title">Where it is served</h2></div></div><div class="passport-table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Availability records for Complete Model" tabindex="0"><table class="passport-table"><caption>Platforms recorded as serving Complete Model, with the date each record takes effect.</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Platform</th><th scope="col">Delivery</th><th scope="col">API identifier</th><th scope="col">Regions</th><th scope="col">Effective</th><th scope="col">Source</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Example Cloud API<span class="cell-note">Cloud platform · operated by Example Cloud</span></th><td>Hosted API</td><td><code>complete-model-2</code></td><td>us-east, eu-west</td><td>From Feb 10, 2026<span class="cell-note">Verified Aug 20, 2026</span></td><td><ul class="row-sources" aria-label="Sources for Example Cloud API"><li><a href="https://cloud.example.com/regions">Example Cloud regional availability<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a><span class="row-source-meta">Example Cloud · official docs · checked Aug 20, 2026</span></li></ul></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Example Hub<span class="cell-note">Model hub · operated by Example Cloud</span></th><td>Downloadable weights</td><td class="passport-unknown">Not recorded</td><td class="passport-unknown">Not recorded</td><td>From Feb 10, 2026<span class="cell-note">Verified Aug 20, 2026</span></td><td><ul class="row-sources" aria-label="Sources for Example Hub"><li><a href="https://lab.example.com/docs">Example Lab documentation<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a><span class="row-source-meta">Example Lab · official docs · checked Aug 1, 2026</span></li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class="passport-section" aria-labelledby="pricing-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">06</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Pricing</span><h2 id="pricing-title">What it costs</h2></div></div><p class="pricing-disclosure"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-scroll-text" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 12h-5"></path><path d="M15 8h-5"></path><path d="M19 17V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4"></path><path d="M8 21h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-1a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H11a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v1a2 2 0 1 1-4 0V5a2 2 0 1 0-4 0v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3"></path></svg>Every price is recorded against one platform, in the currency and unit the vendor published, with the date it took effect. Prices are not converted between currencies or normalised between units, because a converted price is a figure no source states.</p><div class="passport-table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Pricing records for Complete Model" tabindex="0"><table class="passport-table"><caption>Published prices recorded for Complete Model, with currency, unit, effective date, and source.</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Platform</th><th scope="col">Currency</th><th scope="col">Rates</th><th scope="col">Unit</th><th scope="col">Region and tier</th><th scope="col">Effective</th><th scope="col">Source</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Example Cloud API</th><td>USD</td><td><ul class="pricing-rates"><li><span class="pricing-rate-label">Input</span><span class="pricing-rate-amount">USD 0.35</span></li><li><span class="pricing-rate-label">Cached input</span><span class="pricing-rate-amount">USD 0.035</span></li><li><span class="pricing-rate-label">Output</span><span class="pricing-rate-amount">USD 1.40</span></li></ul></td><td>per 1M tokens</td><td>us-east · Standard</td><td>From Feb 10, 2026<span class="cell-note">Verified Aug 20, 2026</span></td><td><ul class="row-sources" aria-label="Sources for the Example Cloud API price"><li><a href="https://cloud.example.com/pricing">Example Cloud pricing<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a><span class="row-source-meta">Example Cloud · official docs · checked Aug 20, 2026</span></li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class="passport-section" aria-labelledby="history-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">07</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Change history</span><h2 id="history-title">What has changed</h2></div></div><ol class="passport-history"><li><p class="history-headline"><span class="history-type">Announced</span><time>Feb 10, 2026</time></p><p>Announced alongside the family refresh.</p><ul class="row-sources" aria-label="Sources for the Announced event"><li><a href="https://lab.example.com/blog/complete">Introducing Complete Model<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a><span class="row-source-meta">Example Lab · official announcement · checked Aug 1, 2026</span></li></ul></li><li><p class="history-headline"><span class="history-type">Generally available</span><time>Mar 2026</time></p><p>Left preview and became generally available.</p><ul class="row-sources" aria-label="Sources for the Generally available event"><li><a href="https://lab.example.com/docs">Example Lab documentation<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a><span class="row-source-meta">Example Lab · official docs · checked Aug 1, 2026</span></li></ul></li></ol></section>"`;

exports[`rendered markup snapshots > open weight 1`] = `"<nav class="passport-actions" aria-label="Actions for this record"><ul><li><a class="passport-action passport-action-compare" href="/ModelTree/compare/?models=open-weight-model" data-action="compare">Compare Open Weight Model with another model</a><span class="passport-action-description">Opens the comparison with this release already chosen. Add one to three more to see them side by side, each value with the source it came from.</span></li><li><a class="passport-action passport-action-evidence" href="#usage-title" data-action="evidence">See the evidence for this record</a><span class="passport-action-description">Jumps to the usage evidence, conditional fit guidance, and primary sources below.</span></li><li><a class="passport-action passport-action-report" href="https://github.com/abdeslam-menacere/ModelTree/issues/new?title=Data+correction%3A+Example+Open+Weight+Model+%28open-weight-model%29&amp;body=Record+slug%3A+open-weight-model%0ARecord%3A+Example+Open+Weight+Model%0ACurrently+verified+at%3A+2026-08-15%0A%0AWhat+is+incorrect%3A%0A%0APrimary+source+that+states+the+correct+value+%28a+URL+is+required%29%3A%0A" data-action="report">Report incorrect data<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a><span class="passport-action-description">Opens a prefilled correction issue naming the record slug open-weight-model.</span></li></ul></nav><section class="passport-section identity-section" aria-labelledby="identity-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">01</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Identity</span><h2 id="identity-title">What it is</h2></div></div><div class="passport-summary"><p class="passport-summary-text">A fictional release whose weights download under a non-OSI licence.</p><p class="passport-purpose"><strong>When to use it.</strong> Exercising openness wording where weights and licence disagree.</p></div><div class="passport-grid"><dl class="passport-facts"><div><dt>Creator</dt><dd>Example Lab</dd></div><div><dt>Family</dt><dd>Complete Family</dd></div><div><dt>Version</dt><dd>1</dd></div><div><dt>Variant</dt><dd>base</dd></div><div><dt>Released</dt><dd>Apr 5, 2026</dd></div><div><dt>Lifecycle status</dt><dd>Available</dd></div><div><dt>Access</dt><dd>Open-weight</dd></div><div><dt>Record slug</dt><dd>open-weight-model</dd></div></dl><div class="passport-names"><h3>Canonical record</h3><dl class="passport-facts"><div><dt>Canonical name</dt><dd>Example Open Weight Model</dd></div><div><dt>Canonical page</dt><dd><code>/ModelTree/models/open-weight-model/</code></dd></div><div><dt>Lifecycle</dt><dd>Available. The vendor’s currently offered version. Shown as “Available”. It is not a claim that the model is recommended or preferred — only that the vendor still offers it.</dd></div></dl><div class="tag-block"><h4>Also known as</h4><ul class="api-aliases"><li>Example Open Weight Model</li></ul></div><p class="passport-unknown">No API identifier is recorded for this release.</p></div></div></section><section class="passport-section" aria-labelledby="technical-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">02</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Technical record</span><h2 id="technical-title">Documented limits</h2></div></div><dl class="technical-facts"><div><dt>Input modalities</dt><dd>text</dd></div><div><dt>Output modalities</dt><dd>text</dd></div><div><dt>Context window</dt><dd>32,768 tokens</dd></div><div><dt>Maximum output</dt><dd class="passport-unknown">Not recorded</dd></div><div><dt>Parameters</dt><dd>70B total</dd></div></dl><div class="tag-groups"><div><span>Categories</span><ul><li>Language and reasoning</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="passport-section" aria-labelledby="access-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">03</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Access and licensing</span><h2 id="access-title">How you can get it</h2></div></div><p class="access-summary"><strong>Open-weight.</strong> Model weights can be downloaded. This alone says nothing about the licence: the schema records downloadable weights and OSI-approval as two separate booleans, so open-weight does not imply open-source.</p><p class="access-methodology"><a href="/ModelTree/methodology/#access">How ModelTree defines access and licensing</a></p><div class="licence-block"><h3>Licence</h3><dl class="technical-facts"><div><dt>Licence</dt><dd><a href="https://lab.example.com/licences/community">Example Community Licence 2.0<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a></dd></div><div><dt>SPDX identifier</dt><dd class="passport-unknown">Not recorded</dd></div><div><dt>Downloadable weights</dt><dd>Weights are documented as downloadable.</dd></div><div><dt>OSI-approved</dt><dd>The licence is not recorded as OSI-approved, so this release is not described as open source.</dd></div></dl></div></section><section class="passport-section not-recorded-section" aria-labelledby="not-recorded-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number" aria-hidden="true">—</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Coverage</span><h2 id="not-recorded-title">What this passport does not record</h2></div></div><p class="not-recorded-intro">These sections are absent from this page because no reviewed record exists for them. They are listed rather than dropped silently, because a missing section and a section ModelTree has decided nothing about look identical otherwise.</p><dl class="not-recorded-list"><div><dt>Where it fits</dt><dd>No predecessor, successor, sibling, or derivation is recorded for this release. ModelTree records a lineage link only where a source states it, and does not infer one from names or release dates.</dd></div><div><dt>Where it is served</dt><dd>No deployment record ties this release to a serving platform. ModelTree has not yet reviewed platform availability for this record; absence is not a claim that the model is unavailable.</dd></div><div><dt>What it costs</dt><dd>No published price is recorded for this release. A price is held only against a reviewed deployment on a named platform, with its currency, unit, and effective date; absence is not a claim that the model is free or unpriced.</dd></div><div><dt>What has changed</dt><dd>No dated release event is recorded for this release beyond its release date. Announcement, availability, and deprecation events are held as separate sourced records, and none has been reviewed for this one.</dd></div></dl></section>"`;

exports[`rendered markup snapshots > proprietary 1`] = `"<nav class="passport-actions" aria-label="Actions for this record"><ul><li><a class="passport-action passport-action-compare" href="/ModelTree/compare/?models=proprietary-model" data-action="compare">Compare Proprietary Model with another model</a><span class="passport-action-description">Opens the comparison with this release already chosen. Add one to three more to see them side by side, each value with the source it came from.</span></li><li><a class="passport-action passport-action-evidence" href="#usage-title" data-action="evidence">See the evidence for this record</a><span class="passport-action-description">Jumps to the usage evidence, conditional fit guidance, and primary sources below.</span></li><li><a class="passport-action passport-action-report" href="https://github.com/abdeslam-menacere/ModelTree/issues/new?title=Data+correction%3A+Example+Proprietary+Model+%28proprietary-model%29&amp;body=Record+slug%3A+proprietary-model%0ARecord%3A+Example+Proprietary+Model%0ACurrently+verified+at%3A+2026-08-15%0A%0AWhat+is+incorrect%3A%0A%0APrimary+source+that+states+the+correct+value+%28a+URL+is+required%29%3A%0A" data-action="report">Report incorrect data<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a><span class="passport-action-description">Opens a prefilled correction issue naming the record slug proprietary-model.</span></li></ul></nav><section class="passport-section identity-section" aria-labelledby="identity-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">01</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Identity</span><h2 id="identity-title">What it is</h2></div></div><div class="passport-summary"><p class="passport-summary-text">A fictional hosted-only release with published prices.</p><p class="passport-purpose"><strong>When to use it.</strong> Exercising pricing and availability without a licence record.</p></div><div class="passport-grid"><dl class="passport-facts"><div><dt>Creator</dt><dd>Example Lab</dd></div><div><dt>Family</dt><dd>Complete Family</dd></div><div><dt>Version</dt><dd>1</dd></div><div><dt>Variant</dt><dd>base</dd></div><div><dt>Released</dt><dd>Jan 20, 2026</dd></div><div><dt>Lifecycle status</dt><dd>Available</dd></div><div><dt>Access</dt><dd>Hosted API</dd></div><div><dt>Record slug</dt><dd>proprietary-model</dd></div></dl><div class="passport-names"><h3>Canonical record</h3><dl class="passport-facts"><div><dt>Canonical name</dt><dd>Example Proprietary Model</dd></div><div><dt>Canonical page</dt><dd><code>/ModelTree/models/proprietary-model/</code></dd></div><div><dt>Lifecycle</dt><dd>Available. The vendor’s currently offered version. Shown as “Available”. It is not a claim that the model is recommended or preferred — only that the vendor still offers it.</dd></div></dl><div class="tag-block"><h4>Also known as</h4><ul class="api-aliases"><li>Example Proprietary Model</li></ul></div><div class="tag-block"><h4>API identifiers</h4><ul class="api-aliases"><li><code>proprietary-model-1</code></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="passport-section" aria-labelledby="technical-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">02</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Technical record</span><h2 id="technical-title">Documented limits</h2></div></div><dl class="technical-facts"><div><dt>Input modalities</dt><dd>text</dd></div><div><dt>Output modalities</dt><dd>text</dd></div><div><dt>Context window</dt><dd>128,000 tokens</dd></div><div><dt>Maximum output</dt><dd class="passport-unknown">Not recorded</dd></div><div><dt>Parameters</dt><dd class="passport-unknown">Not recorded</dd></div></dl><div class="tag-groups"><div><span>Categories</span><ul><li>Language and reasoning</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="passport-section" aria-labelledby="access-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">03</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Access and licensing</span><h2 id="access-title">How you can get it</h2></div></div><p class="access-summary"><strong>Hosted API.</strong> Reachable only through a hosted API or product. No weights are distributed.</p><p class="access-methodology"><a href="/ModelTree/methodology/#access">How ModelTree defines access and licensing</a></p><p class="passport-unknown">No licence record is held for this release. The schema requires one only where a release claims downloadable weights, so its absence here is not a claim that the model is unlicensed.</p></section><section class="passport-section" aria-labelledby="availability-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">04</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Availability</span><h2 id="availability-title">Where it is served</h2></div></div><div class="passport-table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Availability records for Proprietary Model" tabindex="0"><table class="passport-table"><caption>Platforms recorded as serving Proprietary Model, with the date each record takes effect.</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Platform</th><th scope="col">Delivery</th><th scope="col">API identifier</th><th scope="col">Regions</th><th scope="col">Effective</th><th scope="col">Source</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Example Cloud API<span class="cell-note">Cloud platform · operated by Example Cloud</span></th><td>Hosted API</td><td class="passport-unknown">Not recorded</td><td>us-east</td><td>From Jan 20, 2026<span class="cell-note">Verified Jan 20, 2026</span><span class="passport-stale"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg>Not re-checked for 219 days</span></td><td><ul class="row-sources" aria-label="Sources for Example Cloud API"><li><a href="https://cloud.example.com/regions">Example Cloud regional availability<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a><span class="row-source-meta">Example Cloud · official docs · checked Aug 20, 2026</span></li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class="passport-section" aria-labelledby="pricing-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">05</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Pricing</span><h2 id="pricing-title">What it costs</h2></div></div><p class="pricing-disclosure"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-scroll-text" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 12h-5"></path><path d="M15 8h-5"></path><path d="M19 17V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4"></path><path d="M8 21h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-1a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H11a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v1a2 2 0 1 1-4 0V5a2 2 0 1 0-4 0v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3"></path></svg>Every price is recorded against one platform, in the currency and unit the vendor published, with the date it took effect. Prices are not converted between currencies or normalised between units, because a converted price is a figure no source states.</p><div class="passport-table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Pricing records for Proprietary Model" tabindex="0"><table class="passport-table"><caption>Published prices recorded for Proprietary Model, with currency, unit, effective date, and source.</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Platform</th><th scope="col">Currency</th><th scope="col">Rates</th><th scope="col">Unit</th><th scope="col">Region and tier</th><th scope="col">Effective</th><th scope="col">Source</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Example Cloud API</th><td>EUR</td><td><ul class="pricing-rates"><li><span class="pricing-rate-label">Input</span><span class="pricing-rate-amount">EUR 0.002</span></li><li><span class="pricing-rate-label">Output</span><span class="pricing-rate-amount">EUR 0.006</span></li></ul></td><td>per 1K tokens</td><td>eu-west · Batch</td><td>Jan 20, 2026 to May 31, 2026<span class="cell-note">Superseded</span><span class="cell-note">Verified Aug 20, 2026</span></td><td><ul class="row-sources" aria-label="Sources for the Example Cloud API price"><li><a href="https://cloud.example.com/pricing">Example Cloud pricing<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a><span class="row-source-meta">Example Cloud · official docs · checked Aug 20, 2026</span></li></ul></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Example Cloud API</th><td>EUR</td><td><ul class="pricing-rates"><li><span class="pricing-rate-label">Input</span><span class="pricing-rate-amount">EUR 0.0018</span></li><li><span class="pricing-rate-label">Output</span><span class="pricing-rate-amount">EUR 0.0054</span></li></ul></td><td>per 1K tokens</td><td class="passport-unknown">Not recorded</td><td>From Jun 1, 2026<span class="cell-note">Verified Mar 1, 2026</span><span class="passport-stale"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg>Not re-checked for 179 days</span></td><td><ul class="row-sources" aria-label="Sources for the Example Cloud API price"><li><a href="https://cloud.example.com/pricing">Example Cloud pricing<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a><span class="row-source-meta">Example Cloud · official docs · checked Aug 20, 2026</span></li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class="passport-section not-recorded-section" aria-labelledby="not-recorded-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number" aria-hidden="true">—</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Coverage</span><h2 id="not-recorded-title">What this passport does not record</h2></div></div><p class="not-recorded-intro">These sections are absent from this page because no reviewed record exists for them. They are listed rather than dropped silently, because a missing section and a section ModelTree has decided nothing about look identical otherwise.</p><dl class="not-recorded-list"><div><dt>Where it fits</dt><dd>No predecessor, successor, sibling, or derivation is recorded for this release. ModelTree records a lineage link only where a source states it, and does not infer one from names or release dates.</dd></div><div><dt>What has changed</dt><dd>No dated release event is recorded for this release beyond its release date. Announcement, availability, and deprecation events are held as separate sourced records, and none has been reviewed for this one.</dd></div></dl></section>"`;

exports[`rendered markup snapshots > sparse 1`] = `"<nav class="passport-actions" aria-label="Actions for this record"><ul><li><a class="passport-action passport-action-compare" href="/ModelTree/compare/?models=sparse-model" data-action="compare">Compare Sparse Model with another model</a><span class="passport-action-description">Opens the comparison with this release already chosen. Add one to three more to see them side by side, each value with the source it came from.</span></li><li><a class="passport-action passport-action-evidence" href="#usage-title" data-action="evidence">See the evidence for this record</a><span class="passport-action-description">Jumps to the usage evidence, conditional fit guidance, and primary sources below.</span></li><li><a class="passport-action passport-action-report" href="https://github.com/abdeslam-menacere/ModelTree/issues/new?title=Data+correction%3A+Sparse+Model+%28sparse-model%29&amp;body=Record+slug%3A+sparse-model%0ARecord%3A+Sparse+Model%0ACurrently+verified+at%3A+2026-08-15%0A%0AWhat+is+incorrect%3A%0A%0APrimary+source+that+states+the+correct+value+%28a+URL+is+required%29%3A%0A" data-action="report">Report incorrect data<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a><span class="passport-action-description">Opens a prefilled correction issue naming the record slug sparse-model.</span></li></ul></nav><section class="passport-section identity-section" aria-labelledby="identity-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">01</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Identity</span><h2 id="identity-title">What it is</h2></div></div><div class="passport-summary"><p class="passport-summary-text">A fictional release recorded with the bare minimum the schema allows.</p><p class="passport-purpose"><strong>When to use it.</strong> Exercising the passport when almost nothing is recorded.</p></div><div class="passport-grid"><dl class="passport-facts"><div><dt>Creator</dt><dd>Example Lab</dd></div><div><dt>Family</dt><dd>Sparse Family</dd></div><div><dt>Version</dt><dd>1</dd></div><div><dt>Variant</dt><dd>base</dd></div><div><dt>Released</dt><dd>Mar 2026</dd></div><div><dt>Lifecycle status</dt><dd>Preview</dd></div><div><dt>Access</dt><dd>Hosted API</dd></div><div><dt>Record slug</dt><dd>sparse-model</dd></div></dl><div class="passport-names"><h3>Canonical record</h3><dl class="passport-facts"><div><dt>Canonical name</dt><dd>Sparse Model</dd></div><div><dt>Canonical page</dt><dd><code>/ModelTree/models/sparse-model/</code></dd></div><div><dt>Lifecycle</dt><dd>Preview. Announced and testable but not yet the vendor’s generally-available version. Recorded when the source calls it a preview, beta, or early access.</dd></div></dl><p class="passport-unknown">No API identifier is recorded for this release.</p></div></div></section><section class="passport-section" aria-labelledby="technical-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">02</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Technical record</span><h2 id="technical-title">Documented limits</h2></div></div><dl class="technical-facts"><div><dt>Input modalities</dt><dd>text</dd></div><div><dt>Output modalities</dt><dd>text</dd></div><div><dt>Context window</dt><dd class="passport-unknown">Not recorded</dd></div><div><dt>Maximum output</dt><dd class="passport-unknown">Not recorded</dd></div><div><dt>Parameters</dt><dd class="passport-unknown">Not recorded</dd></div></dl><div class="tag-groups"><div><span>Categories</span><ul><li>Coding</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="passport-section" aria-labelledby="access-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number">03</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Access and licensing</span><h2 id="access-title">How you can get it</h2></div></div><p class="access-summary"><strong>Hosted API.</strong> Reachable only through a hosted API or product. No weights are distributed.</p><p class="access-methodology"><a href="/ModelTree/methodology/#access">How ModelTree defines access and licensing</a></p><p class="passport-unknown">No licence record is held for this release. The schema requires one only where a release claims downloadable weights, so its absence here is not a claim that the model is unlicensed.</p></section><section class="passport-section not-recorded-section" aria-labelledby="not-recorded-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="section-number" aria-hidden="true">—</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Coverage</span><h2 id="not-recorded-title">What this passport does not record</h2></div></div><p class="not-recorded-intro">These sections are absent from this page because no reviewed record exists for them. They are listed rather than dropped silently, because a missing section and a section ModelTree has decided nothing about look identical otherwise.</p><dl class="not-recorded-list"><div><dt>Where it fits</dt><dd>No predecessor, successor, sibling, or derivation is recorded for this release. ModelTree records a lineage link only where a source states it, and does not infer one from names or release dates.</dd></div><div><dt>Where it is served</dt><dd>No deployment record ties this release to a serving platform. ModelTree has not yet reviewed platform availability for this record; absence is not a claim that the model is unavailable.</dd></div><div><dt>What it costs</dt><dd>No published price is recorded for this release. A price is held only against a reviewed deployment on a named platform, with its currency, unit, and effective date; absence is not a claim that the model is free or unpriced.</dd></div><div><dt>What has changed</dt><dd>No dated release event is recorded for this release beyond its release date. Announcement, availability, and deprecation events are held as separate sourced records, and none has been reviewed for this one.</dd></div></dl></section>"`;
